# Feature: account
# Use-case: uc.account.update-profile
# Use-case doc: ../../../../docs/wiki/features/account/use-cases/uc.account.update-profile.md

### Read current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Update profile fields
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "{{accountDisplayName}}",
  "username": "{{accountUsername}}"
}
